{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreadway is an online co-op survival horror with crafting, proximity voice chat, terrifying monsters, and voice-driven interactions. You and up to three friends travel through a post-apocalyptic world, collect junk, craft survival devices, and interact with the game through voice chat.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A CO-OP EXTRACTION HORROR WHERE YOUR VOICE IS THE KEY.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/5dda30a2796ea63eca8255b69b4c2538.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/5dda30a2796ea63eca8255b69b4c2538.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/5dda30a2796ea63eca8255b69b4c2538.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  YOUR VOICE IS THE KEY  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use voice chat to open code locks and doors.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/6354b19585d40199400adcc621050862.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/6354b19585d40199400adcc621050862.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/6354b19585d40199400adcc621050862.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/070aedf96398cd88f5bfa8846a065e04.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/070aedf96398cd88f5bfa8846a065e04.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/070aedf96398cd88f5bfa8846a065e04.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  SCREAM TO SURVIVE  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters react to you. Scream the code word to scare them away\u2026</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/a997a52e48145b2902da1049357e44f2.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/a997a52e48145b2902da1049357e44f2.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/a997a52e48145b2902da1049357e44f2.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  KICK YOUR FRIENDS  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick your teammates to interrupt, save, troll, or shove them into trouble. Co-op chaos.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/bd85946d55a2bd8f70035f0ac5f7eb20.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/bd85946d55a2bd8f70035f0ac5f7eb20.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/bd85946d55a2bd8f70035f0ac5f7eb20.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  FEED THE TRAIN  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The train constantly needs fuel. Burn everything you collected to keep it moving.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/1a9a015b3d407b49fdec3aa150470290.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/1a9a015b3d407b49fdec3aa150470290.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/1a9a015b3d407b49fdec3aa150470290.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  HAVE FUN TOGETHER  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goof around, improvise \u2014 every run is your unique story with friends.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/e5b9245283ffdf9fd99ccf811d3a8674.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/e5b9245283ffdf9fd99ccf811d3a8674.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/e5b9245283ffdf9fd99ccf811d3a8674.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  AVOID TRAPS  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused and watch your step \u2014 one mistake can ruin the whole expedition.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/0c5ffc33fe7225b68dff5e3af8279df4.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/0c5ffc33fe7225b68dff5e3af8279df4.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/0c5ffc33fe7225b68dff5e3af8279df4.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  COLLECT RESOURCES  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect junk and important resources \u2014 every item can save you\u2026 or doom you.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/c614bb2b93a40018ab14288c4d07e979.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/c614bb2b93a40018ab14288c4d07e979.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/c614bb2b93a40018ab14288c4d07e979.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  CRAFT ITEMS  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools and devices from everything you find. Upgrade your characters.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/4482c4b4be4d12c4ea9253ef5f4f048a.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/4482c4b4be4d12c4ea9253ef5f4f048a.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/4482c4b4be4d12c4ea9253ef5f4f048a.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online co-op up to 4 players<br></li><li>Co-op puzzles in bunkers<br></li><li>Monsters with unique behavior<br></li><li>Proximity voice chat \u2014 talk at a distance<br></li><li>Voice gameplay: code locks, doors<br></li><li>Monsters can hear you \u2014 your voice can reveal your position<br></li><li>Scream the code word to scare monsters away<br></li><li>Crafting from found junk: tools, devices, survival gear<br></li><li>Character upgrades<br></li><li>Kicks for chaos and sabotage<br></li><li>A train that must be fueled<br></li><li>Traps and hazards</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3215820?t=1768263114","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3215820?t=1768263114","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/192d2f3a3eacd5d513a343b934ba4528356dca01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768263114","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/192d2f3a3eacd5d513a343b934ba4528356dca01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768263114","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3296430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreadway is an online co-op survival horror with crafting, proximity voice chat, terrifying monsters, and voice-driven interactions. You and up to three friends travel through a post-apocalyptic world, collect junk, craft survival devices, and interact with the game through voice chat.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A CO-OP EXTRACTION HORROR WHERE YOUR VOICE IS THE KEY.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/5dda30a2796ea63eca8255b69b4c2538.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/5dda30a2796ea63eca8255b69b4c2538.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/5dda30a2796ea63eca8255b69b4c2538.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  YOUR VOICE IS THE KEY  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use voice chat to open code locks and doors.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/6354b19585d40199400adcc621050862.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/6354b19585d40199400adcc621050862.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/6354b19585d40199400adcc621050862.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/070aedf96398cd88f5bfa8846a065e04.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/070aedf96398cd88f5bfa8846a065e04.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/070aedf96398cd88f5bfa8846a065e04.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  SCREAM TO SURVIVE  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters react to you. Scream the code word to scare them away\u2026</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/a997a52e48145b2902da1049357e44f2.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/a997a52e48145b2902da1049357e44f2.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/a997a52e48145b2902da1049357e44f2.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  KICK YOUR FRIENDS  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick your teammates to interrupt, save, troll, or shove them into trouble. Co-op chaos.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/bd85946d55a2bd8f70035f0ac5f7eb20.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/bd85946d55a2bd8f70035f0ac5f7eb20.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/bd85946d55a2bd8f70035f0ac5f7eb20.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  FEED THE TRAIN  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The train constantly needs fuel. Burn everything you collected to keep it moving.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/1a9a015b3d407b49fdec3aa150470290.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/1a9a015b3d407b49fdec3aa150470290.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/1a9a015b3d407b49fdec3aa150470290.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  HAVE FUN TOGETHER  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goof around, improvise \u2014 every run is your unique story with friends.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/e5b9245283ffdf9fd99ccf811d3a8674.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/e5b9245283ffdf9fd99ccf811d3a8674.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/e5b9245283ffdf9fd99ccf811d3a8674.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  AVOID TRAPS  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused and watch your step \u2014 one mistake can ruin the whole expedition.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/0c5ffc33fe7225b68dff5e3af8279df4.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/0c5ffc33fe7225b68dff5e3af8279df4.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/0c5ffc33fe7225b68dff5e3af8279df4.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2622\u2622\u2622  COLLECT RESOURCES  \u2622\u2622\u2622</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect junk and important resources \u2014 every item can save you\u2026 or doom you.</p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/c614bb2b93a40018ab14288c4d07e979.poster.avif?t=1768263114\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/c614bb2b93a40018ab14288c4d07e979.webm?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/c614bb2b93a40018ab14288c4d07e979.mp4?t=1768263114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u250